  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-13T05:15:45.894005Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-13T05:30:36.068998Z",
  "totalBlocks": 86,
  "translatedBlocks": 86,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf8ec5b0183c5acb",
      "translationZh": "构建多模型智能体 AI 应用的组织正面临日益复杂的基础设施。管理多种模型类型的容器编排、扩缩容策略、身份和可观测性，会增加运维开销。团队往往花在基础设施上的时间比花在智能体逻辑开发上的时间更多。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a00e34e127a42d14",
      "translationZh": "在自主管理的基础设施上运行智能体框架的开发者，例如使用结合 AWS Fargate 的 Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS)，可以完全控制其部署配置。随着智能体工作负载不断演进和扩展，团队可能会选择采用托管运行时，以获得内置的会话管理、身份和可观测性功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae6afec5994b480c",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 是一个平台，可使用任意框架或模型大规模构建、连接和优化智能体。AgentCore runtime 是其托管部署功能，负责处理容器生命周期、扩缩容、身份和可观测性，让您能够专注于智能体代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab7199f77e0c4c75",
      "translationZh": "在上一篇文章《在 AWS 上使用 Hugging Face smolagents 多模型框架实现智能体 AI》中，我们展示了如何在自主管理的基础设施上构建具备多模型编排能力的医疗健康 AI 智能体。在本文中，我们将展示如何将该多模型智能体迁移到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime。此次迁移在保留智能体能力的同时减少了基础设施管理工作，这些能力包括三模型编排和向量增强的知识检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bee0f942f4122f50",
      "translationZh": "本解决方案将一个多模型医疗健康 AI 智能体迁移到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime，同时保留现有的智能体逻辑。该智能体通过三个模型后端处理医疗查询，并利用向量增强的知识检索，所有这些功能都在一个由 AgentCore 管理的容器内运行。您可以将每个查询定向到适合该任务的模型后端。Amazon SageMaker AI 上的 BioM-ELECTRA-Large-SQuAD2 等领域专用模型负责处理专业的生物医学查询，而 Amazon Bedrock 上由 Meta 提供的 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct 等基础模型（FM）则负责处理更广泛的医学推理。这种方法有助于医疗健康团队应对各种查询类型，同时减少管理底层基础设施所带来的运维开销。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d4a1153799cf6685",
      "translationZh": "上一篇文章中的独立版本部署在结合 AWS Fargate 的 Amazon ECS 上，其容器编排、扩缩容、身份和可观测性均由用户配置。AgentCore 版本使用 AgentCore runtime 装饰器模式封装相同的智能体逻辑，而这些运维事项则由 AgentCore runtime 自动处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dec6589b6ddc7cd6",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face smolagents 是一个开源 Python 库，旨在通过几行代码构建和运行智能体。本解决方案使用 Hugging Face smolagents 框架作为参考实现，展示了 AgentCore runtime 对任意智能体框架的支持。采用自带（BYO）智能体的方式，您可以将现有智能体代码部署到 AgentCore runtime，无需重写代码或针对特定框架进行适配。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39d4a0d014ccbd5d",
      "translationZh": "注意：本解决方案是用于演示的示例实现。处理医疗或其他敏感查询的生产部署会使用 Amazon Bedrock Guardrails 进行内容过滤和依据验证，作为标准控制措施。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ace2ec97069e099a",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案包含以下服务和功能：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24cd310e49bd8a03",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime，用于托管式智能体容器部署、扩缩容、身份管理和可观测性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9c4a0b2c8d6da0f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock，搭配 Meta 的 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct，用于复杂的医学推理。有关各 AWS Region 的模型可用性，请参阅 Amazon Bedrock 中的“各 AWS Region 支持的模型”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5832c7f954251fba",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI，搭配 BioM-ELECTRA-Large-SQuAD2，用于专业的生物医学查询和托管式自动扩缩容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "53f80bc50aebd4c1",
      "translationZh": "Amazon OpenSearch Service，通过医学知识索引实现向量相似度匹配和上下文知识检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5c93638319dadd35",
      "translationZh": "搭载 BioM-ELECTRA-Large-SQuAD2 的容器化模型服务器，用于自托管模型部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6ec7de8ac8fecd1c",
      "translationZh": "AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)，用于安全和访问控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6b4b54472f3b7e8",
      "translationZh": "注意：上一篇文章（独立版本）使用 Anthropic 的 Claude 3.5 Sonnet V2。本文使用 Meta 的 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct，展示了 AgentCore runtime 不依赖于特定模型。模型选择是一项实现决策，而非必要要求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8484b064eca37727",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了解决方案架构，以及智能体如何在三个模型后端之间进行编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5ae6b4f9d05b91d",
      "translationZh": "图 1：Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime 上的多模型医疗健康智能体架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d824e441d6742ee",
      "translationZh": "客户端 Web 界面连接到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime，后者托管医疗健康智能体容器。该容器使用 Hugging Face smolagents 框架，并配合 AgentCore runtime 装饰器。AgentCore runtime 提供内置的身份管理和可观测性功能。智能体在三个模型后端之间进行编排：搭载 BioM-ELECTRA 的 Amazon SageMaker AI、搭载 Meta 的 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct 的 Amazon Bedrock，以及搭载 BioM-ELECTRA 的容器化模型服务器。该解决方案包含 Amazon OpenSearch Service，用于向量增强的知识检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6eb8b57de1a4c4b2",
      "translationZh": "该解决方案支持多种部署选项，每个后端都针对不同场景进行了优化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22ec885adcc5eb47",
      "translationZh": "Amazon SageMaker AI：使用 Hugging Face Hub 模型，提供支持自动扩缩容的托管端点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74bfd4f701f12ec4",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock：通过 AWS APIs 提供对基础模型的无服务器访问和复杂推理能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dc506f8f56d10538",
      "translationZh": "容器化模型服务器：用于自托管模型部署，以及来自 Hugging Face Hub 的工具集成（可部署在 Amazon ECS、Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS) 或其他容器环境中）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d0cd0325ae0c49c8",
      "translationZh": "这三个后端均实现了 Hugging Face Messages API 兼容性，无论选择哪种模型服务，都能提供一致的请求和响应格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70ad858e7328d0ce",
      "translationZh": "完整实现可在 sample-healthcare-agent-with-agentcore-on-aws GitHub 仓库中获取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5f66c1a5198e7a85",
      "translationZh": "将智能体迁移到 AgentCore 运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98a33ee2a7e4e89b",
      "translationZh": "本节逐步介绍如何使用 AgentCore CLI 将现有的医疗保健 AI 智能体迁移到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f18f102eb742616",
      "translationZh": "部署此解决方案之前，你需要具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f775e65af131c75",
      "translationZh": "一个 AWS 账户，能够访问 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时，并具有创建 IAM 角色和 Amazon OpenSearch Service 域的适当权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e3878785ec51ffe",
      "translationZh": "已安装并配置 AWS Command Line Interface (AWS CLI) 2.0 或更高版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22a07ab998f716da",
      "translationZh": "Node.js 20 或更高版本（部署 CLI 所必需）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6921d91948e9c579",
      "translationZh": "已安装 AWS Cloud Development Kit (AWS CDK)。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25cd7e40176128e0",
      "translationZh": "已安装 AgentCore CLI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "950a103619e9e6c3",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.10 或更高版本，用于运行部署脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a62acde5cdd55c5",
      "translationZh": "已安装并运行 Docker（代码执行隔离所必需）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdc4bd95206170ff",
      "translationZh": "能够访问您所在 AWS Region 中的 Amazon Bedrock 模型、Amazon SageMaker AI 和 Amazon OpenSearch Service 域，并具备创建和管理资源所需的适当 IAM 权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9ba924985bc5404e",
      "translationZh": "已安装 bedrock-agentcore Python SDK。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7df56706055125b2",
      "translationZh": "在此实现中，我们使用 Python 3.10+、smolagents 框架、transformers 4.55.0+ 和 boto3。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "87adec43b17c1406",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时概念",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae0e7a175160737f",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时使用装饰器模式来封装您的智能体逻辑。关键组件包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3380fa211305d56c",
      "translationZh": "BedrockAgentCoreApp —— 初始化 AgentCore 应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fb51b7cbfd5fd462",
      "translationZh": "@app.entrypoint —— 用于装饰请求到达时由 AgentCore 运行时调用的函数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c4d9d873836414df",
      "translationZh": "app.run() —— 启动 AgentCore 运行时服务器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de536691d63b5ad5",
      "translationZh": "以下代码展示了 AgentCore 的集成模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ac37cffc2faf27b",
      "translationZh": "装饰器与 return 语句之间的智能体代码与独立运行版本保持不变。AgentCore 运行时会自动处理容器生命周期、扩缩容、身份和可观测性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48c45d475c30dccb",
      "translationZh": "使用 AgentCore CLI 创建一个 AgentCore 项目，并添加你现有的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f91c16cd2c7e2ee7",
      "translationZh": "安装 AgentCore CLI：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2975d3988d949d43",
      "translationZh": "创建一个新的 AgentCore 项目：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d4c2025e350f964",
      "translationZh": "将你现有的智能体添加为自带（BYO）智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2c9a43349402045",
      "translationZh": "注意：--framework 标志指定 CLI 模板。实际的智能体代码使用 Hugging Face smolagents，无论选择哪种模板，它都与 AgentCore 运行时兼容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91fc45e1a983b5ba",
      "translationZh": "准备容器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cad67ba388b741a1",
      "translationZh": "在你的智能体代码目录中创建一个 pyproject.toml，以定义依赖项：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e64dfcb1ee68793b",
      "translationZh": "创建一个 .dockerignore，将镜像大小控制在 2 GB 限制以内：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8244153dabc600c4",
      "translationZh": "部署到 AgentCore 运行时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67e6e38f80010ab7",
      "translationZh": "配置好项目后，你可以使用一条 CLI 命令部署智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8dbc2f9045456445",
      "translationZh": "CLI 会构建容器，将其推送到 Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR)，并创建 AgentCore 运行时智能体。部署大约需要 10–15 分钟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c5e54273c0ac8c0e",
      "translationZh": "测试已部署的智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9acf39c8ee190c89",
      "translationZh": "你可以通过两种方式测试已部署的智能体：使用 AgentCore CLI，或通过 boto3 以编程方式测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eadcae79d40dc3b8",
      "translationZh": "使用 AgentCore CLI 调用智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca41437dad7ceb15",
      "translationZh": "或者，使用 boto3 以编程方式调用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0ed4cb4737af893d",
      "translationZh": "这种方式直接使用 boto3 SDK，调用的已部署智能体与 CLI 调用的相同。agentRuntimeArn 标识你已部署的智能体，contentType 指定请求格式，payload 承载提示词和模型选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1775bc94b5cf517e",
      "translationZh": "与自管理部署的主要区别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7933ae1c60761ec",
      "translationZh": "独立版本和 AgentCore 运行时版本以不同方式部署同一个智能体。以下各节将介绍每种方式提供的功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2096c67886e5e0de",
      "translationZh": "使用 AWS Fargate 的 Amazon ECS 部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "321db7975b9834b8",
      "translationZh": "独立版本在 Amazon ECS 上运行，并使用 AWS Fargate。你需要定义 ECS 任务定义和服务配置、设置自动扩缩容策略、为每个服务配置 IAM 角色，并通过 Amazon CloudWatch 设置可观测性。部署过程包括 Docker 构建、推送到 Amazon ECR，以及更新 ECS 服务。这种方式让你能够完全控制容器配置、网络和扩缩容行为。智能体代码位于 healthcare_agentcore.py 中，与 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon SageMaker AI 和容器化后端集成，并使用 Amazon OpenSearch Service 进行向量搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1a2a4c2ed5e4d6d5",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1a1cb9b1259a08f",
      "translationZh": "AgentCore 运行时版本采用 AgentCore 装饰器模式，运行相同的 healthcare_agentcore.py 智能体代码。AgentCore 运行时提供容器编排、基于会话的扩缩容、通过 IAM 集成实现的身份管理，以及通过内置追踪和日志记录实现的可观测性。部署只需一条命令（agentcore deploy）。模型集成（Amazon Bedrock、Amazon SageMaker AI、容器化后端）和向量搜索（Amazon OpenSearch Service）均与独立版本相同。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5e0a9b7b4aea900",
      "translationZh": "这两种部署方式各有优势。Amazon ECS 搭配 AWS Fargate 可让你完全控制容器配置、网络和扩缩容策略，适合已有容器运维专业能力或具有特定基础设施要求的团队。Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 运行时则适合倾向于使用托管基础设施、希望主要专注于智能体逻辑开发的团队。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5bbee9ad268923e4",
      "translationZh": "无论采用哪种部署方式，从独立版本迁移到 AgentCore 运行时时，以下要素均保持不变：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "399198cf781b8e15",
      "translationZh": "核心智能体逻辑（BedrockAgentCoreApp 装饰器 + 现有代码）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7145c8ece2d7c009",
      "translationZh": "跨 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon SageMaker AI 和容器化后端的多模型编排。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8b509a197d84366",
      "translationZh": "使用 Amazon OpenSearch Service 进行向量增强的知识检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "75834f9213a25cce",
      "translationZh": "Hugging Face Messages API 在不同模型后端之间的兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2f859889d036899",
      "translationZh": "为避免今后产生费用，请在不再需要时删除您创建的资源。如果您计划继续使用已部署的智能体，则无需采取任何操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8a126cb5bb934e57",
      "translationZh": "移除 AgentCore runtime 智能体：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5fd0ac31651f811f",
      "translationZh": "首先，从本地配置中移除所有资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7177470bae888133",
      "translationZh": "然后再次部署，以拆除 AWS 资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37bb724a6362c135",
      "translationZh": "删除 Amazon SageMaker AI 端点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c819983d635ed0f3",
      "translationZh": "删除 Amazon OpenSearch Service 域：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8cea64185dd36bef",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们展示了如何将一个多模型医疗 AI 智能体从采用 AWS Fargate 基础设施的自管理 Amazon ECS 迁移到 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore runtime。此次迁移无需更改智能体的核心逻辑。同一个 healthcare_agentcore.py 文件在 Amazon Bedrock、Amazon SageMaker AI 和容器化模型服务器之间进行编排。通过添加 AgentCore 装饰器模式（BedrockAgentCoreApp、@app.entrypoint 和 app.run()），它便可在 AgentCore runtime 上运行。对于医疗团队而言，这种模式会将专业的生物医学查询导向领域专用模型，例如 Amazon SageMaker AI 上的 BioM-ELECTRA-Large-SQuAD2。它会将更广泛的医学推理路由至基础模型，例如 Amazon Bedrock 上由 Meta 提供的 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct。这些后端共同支持多种查询类型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec1200cbcd7adb36",
      "translationZh": "对于选择托管基础设施的团队，AgentCore 运行时负责处理容器编排、扩缩容、身份管理和可观测性。这样，你就可以专注于智能体逻辑的开发。不依赖特定框架的设计支持多种模型与智能体框架的组合，使这种迁移模式适用于医疗保健、金融服务和制造业等各个行业。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "971c8698588360c1",
      "translationZh": "要开始使用，请克隆 GitHub 仓库 sample-healthcare-agent-with-agentcore-on-aws，并按照本文中的部署步骤操作。要了解本文迁移前的独立实现，请参阅《在 AWS 上使用 Hugging Face smolagents 构建采用多模型框架的智能体式 AI》。如果对如何开始使用 Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 有疑问，请咨询 AWS 生成式 AI 专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "488edceb8ce3fc6c",
      "translationZh": "AWS 上的智能体式 AI——使用 AWS 构建、部署和扩展 AI 智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
